Step 11 — WhatsApp Instance Create Karna

Evolution API me pehle ek instance create karna hai.

Aapki API ka base URL:

http://15.206.165.147:8080

Aur API key jo aapne docker-compose.yml me set ki hai, wahi authentication key hai.

11.1 Instance create command

AWS terminal me ye command run mat karo abhi; pehle hum API request properly banayenge.

Hum endpoint use karenge:

POST /instance/create

Iske liye hume:

API URL
API Key
Instance name
Integration

set karna hoga.

Example instance:

marketing
11.2 Sabse easy method — Swagger/API Manager

Aapke response me ye URL bhi diya hai:

http://15.206.165.147:8080/manager

Browser me open karo:

Evolution API Manager

Agar login/API key maange, apni current API key enter karo.

⚠️ Security

API key mujhe mat bhejna.

Abhi ek kaam karo

Browser me:

http://15.206.165.147:8080/manager

open karo.
Scan Karo Connect karo 


